{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-04T10:13:42.608Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"5a19c20da0d320085dc6f794","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-04T10:13:42.608Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Pins raised: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.4 (exact), pm-ops 2026.10.4, pm-changelog 2026.9.25, jscpd ^5.4.0 (newer than #122's 5.3.2). Carried #122's zero-duplication fixes (shared main-invocation guard, single JSON render, accept-packed PM_PATH isolation) with its pm item pm-gantt-chart-chso; its drifted history chain re-anchored under CLI 2026.10.4, clearing the gate_failing history_drift health finding. Unused direct fast-glob devDep removed, clearing the braces GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm chain: npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both 0 vulnerabilities. Consolidated #123 (codeql-action SHA 1c5b6756), #125 (@types/node 26.6.4), #126/#127. Full npm run release:check PASS with unchanged zero-duplication gate and coverage thresholds; accept:packed green on hosts 2026.10.4 and 2026.8.20. npx pm health exit 0 (2 pre-existing advisories). Real-tracker dogfood via npx and bunx passed (gantt render, group-by, json/svg export). pm-github 2026.10.4 managed extension with read-only previews only."}],"before_hash":"768853bb34f0c38e7caa40b736f7d858ed20d9c7d30d7a5040b013a2dbbf923b","after_hash":"d024a83e0e84aae95b42305e96031772d51b08756004e3b046e2ea5647b2fd80","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"79d3b045271d9a33a2ddc3cdc84a32cafbf2da07d64c24b95f405f110b7e9b2e"}
